{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-07-20 13:01:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES 360TRAINING ON ITS SIGNIFICANT INVESTMENT FROM GREYLION PARTNERS LP AND VESTAR CAPITAL PARTNERS', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT ADVISED 360TRAINING ON ITS SIGNIFICANT INVESTMENT FROM GREYLION PARTNERS LP (GREYLION) AND VESTAR CAPITAL PARTNERS (VESTAR). THE INVESTMENT FROM VESTAR AND GREYLION WILL PROVIDE 360TRAINING WITH ADDITIONAL SIGNIFICANT CAPITAL BACKING TO ACCELERATE ITS ORGANIC AND INORGANIC GROWTH INITIATIVES. 360TRAINING IS A LEADING ONLINE TRAINING AND COMPLIANCE PLATFORM FOR HIGHLY'}